WEBVTT

00:10:58.818 --> 00:11:00.734
where teams of humans and computers

00:11:00.734 --> 00:11:02.833
could work together,

00:11:02.833 --> 00:11:05.990
and the winning team had no grandmaster,

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.455
and it had no supercomputer.

00:11:08.455 --> 00:11:12.630
What they had was better teamwork,

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:17.646
and they showed that a team of humans and computers,

00:11:17.646 --> 00:11:20.694
working together, could beat any computer

00:11:20.694 --> 00:11:24.214
or any human working alone.

00:11:24.214 --> 00:11:25.878
Racing with the machine

00:11:25.878 --> 00:11:28.221
beats racing against the machine.

00:11:28.221 --> 00:11:30.785
Technology is not destiny.